member.summary:
School calendar — admin/principal-only writes for holidays + weekend config;
any authenticated user can read the non-working dates (used by the daily
attendance picker on the teacher screen).

EMP-08: Persist metadata for an uploaded document (photo / CNIC / degree / etc.).
File bytes themselves should be uploaded via the FileUpload module first;
pass the resulting FilePath here. Setting IsPhoto=true also stamps Employee.PhotoPath.

Inventory Management — INV-01..INV-08.
Teachers can initiate issue requests (via existing Issue endpoint with their own staff id);
Admin/Accountant own purchases, adjustments and approvals.
